{"3369220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BitBeasts", "steam_appid": 3369220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The demo is available in English only. The full game will be fully localized in 13 languages.</u></strong></p></p><br><h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <i>BitBeasts</i> <strong>demo</strong> will be released on Steam in June 2026 as part of the <strong>Bullet Festival</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We can’t wait for you to try it, and we’d love to hear all your feedback on our Discord server – help us make the game even better! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369220/extras/bed14039a4dd5a34961ae5d885f660d3.avif?t=1786635523\" width=496 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Build your own ship, evolve alien Beasts, and challenge the Exodius Fleet in an ultra-hard roguelite space shooter.</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose your ship</i></strong><i> – Every ship offers unique abilities and a completely different playstyle.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Collect, craft, and evolve alien Beasts</i></strong><i> to create powerful synergies.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unlock talents</i></strong><i> and customize your build to match your strategy.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gather resources and craft upgrades</i></strong><i> to become stronger with every run.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Battle the Exodius Fleet's deadliest drones</i></strong><i>, each designed to test your skills.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Research mysterious alien lifeforms</i></strong><i> and expand your collection in the Laboratory.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Enter the Endless Battlefield</i></strong><i>, filled with endless waves, random events, and valuable rewards.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master one of the most challenging space shooters</i></strong><i>, where every mistake can cost you the run</i>.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Build your own ship, evolve alien Beasts, and challenge the Exodius Fleet in an ultra-hard roguelite space shooter.</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose your ship</i></strong><i> – Every ship offers unique abilities and a completely different playstyle.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Collect, craft, and evolve alien Beasts</i></strong><i> to create powerful synergies.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unlock talents</i></strong><i> and customize your build to match your strategy.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gather resources and craft upgrades</i></strong><i> to become stronger with every run.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Battle the Exodius Fleet's deadliest drones</i></strong><i>, each designed to test your skills.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Research mysterious alien lifeforms</i></strong><i> and expand your collection in the Laboratory.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Enter the Endless Battlefield</i></strong><i>, filled with endless waves, random events, and valuable rewards.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master one of the most challenging space shooters</i></strong><i>, where every mistake can cost you the run</i>.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Can you survive humanity's deadliest drones? Build your ship, evolve alien Beasts, unlock powerful talents, and fight through an ultra-hard roguelite space shooter where every run is different.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Hungarian, Russian, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369220/3c7b6409497695bc36faa9f4cd7fea9a3fcb8117/header.jpg?t=1786635523", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369220/f8caac4447ccded00d70b875accb8072243c7fef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786635523", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369220/f8caac4447ccded00d70b875accb8072243c7fef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786635523", "website": "https://bitblaststudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / Dedicated GPU with 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5 or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 280 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> D